# Selective Test Running

- During an implementation plan, run the smallest checks that directly cover the code changed in the task just completed.
- Prefer targeted unit tests, individual test files or filters, crate-specific tests, package-specific tests, and focused lint/type checks while iterating.
- Do not run workspace-wide or otherwise full test suites between plan tasks unless the user explicitly requests it or targeted checks would be misleading.
- Run full test suites only once, at the very end of the plan, after all targeted checks are clean.
- Do not run `cargo test` or `cargo clippy` directly; use the scoped `mise run` tasks below (they route through nextest and skip doc tests where appropriate).

## Scoped Rust tasks (preferred while iterating)

| Task | Example |
| --- | --- |
| `rust-lint-crate` | `mise run rust-lint-crate -- finstack-quant-core` |
| `rust-lint-crate --lib` | `mise run rust-lint-crate -- finstack-quant-core --lib` |
| `rust-fix-crate` | `mise run rust-fix-crate -- finstack-quant-scenarios` |
| `rust-test-crate` | `mise run rust-test-crate -- finstack-quant-valuations` |
| `rust-test-integration` | `mise run rust-test-integration -- finstack-quant-valuations valuations` |
| `rust-test-filter` | `mise run rust-test-filter -- finstack-quant-core test_bond_pricing` |
| `rust-bench-crate` | `mise run rust-bench-crate -- finstack-quant-portfolio materialization` |
| `rust-build-crate` | `mise run rust-build-crate -- finstack-quant-portfolio` |

Add `--all-features` to `rust-lint-crate` / `rust-fix-crate` when touching feature-gated code. Add `--lib` to `rust-lint-crate` to skip integration-test binaries. Add `--slow` to test tasks for ignored tests.

## Full-workspace tasks (final verification / CI only)

- `mise run rust-lint` — full-workspace fmt check + clippy on lib/bins/tests/examples (skips benches). Run before commit or when the user asks for full lint.
- `mise run rust-test` — all crates, all integration binaries.
- `mise run rust-bench` — all Criterion targets.
- `mise run all-lint`, `mise run all-test`, `mise run all-ci` — cross-language full gates.

